---
import metrics from '../data/metrics.json';
---

<section id="descargar" class="py-24 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
  <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Descargar y probar</h2>
  <p class="text-transit-text-mid mb-12 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    Disponible para Android. Instalación directa desde GitHub Releases.
  </p>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-8 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="text-5xl mb-4">📱</div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">APK Android</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mb-4">
        Versión {metrics.release.version} · {metrics.release.apkSize} · Android 6.0+
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/astralk9999/Transitly/releases/download/v1.0.0-tfg/app-release.apk"
        class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-transit-accent text-white rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-transit-accent/90 transition text-sm"
        download
      >
        Descargar APK
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-8 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🌐</div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Web completa</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mb-4">
        Marketing site en desarrollo
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/astralk9999/Transitly/tree/master/astro"
        class="inline-block px-6 py-3 border border-transit-accent text-transit-accent rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-transit-accent-bg transition text-sm"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Ver web completa →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 bg-transit-bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised max-w-2xl mx-auto text-left">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Instrucciones de instalación</h3>
    <ol class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm space-y-2 list-decimal list-inside">
      <li>Descarga el APK desde el botón superior</li>
      <li>En tu Android: Ajustes → Seguridad → Permitir instalación desde fuentes desconocidas</li>
      <li>Abre el APK descargado e instala</li>
      <li>Abre Transitly y selecciona "Continuar como invitado" o regístrate</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
